# Scalers Frontend 2.0 mandate

Charter: `docs/frontend/FRONTEND_2_0_CHARTER.md`. It wins over older frontend docs. Bar: WhatsApp, Instagram, Truecaller clarity on a mid-range Android at 08:00 EAT.

## Build from the kit

- Primitives live in `dashboard/src/components/ui/`: `Button`, `IconButton`, `Field`, `Input`, `Textarea`, `Select`, `Segmented`, `Switch`, `Stamp`, `Avatar`, `ListRow`, `PageHeader`, `Sheet`, `Menu`, `Tooltip`, `Empty`, `Skeleton`, `Table`. Use them. Do not compose a new button from class strings.
- Behavior comes from Base UI. Icons come from Heroicons. No other UI runtime.
- One `AppShell` for desk and admin. Tabs below `md`, rail on `md+`. Nested routes hide tabs and lead with Back.

## Tokens or nothing

- Colors: `canvas`, `surface`, `surface-2`, `hairline`, `ink`, `ink-2`, `ink-3`, `accent`, `accent-tonal`, `brand`, `attention`, `ok`, `whatsapp`. No hex in `.tsx`.
- `#005CCC` (`accent`) is the only filled action color. One filled action per viewport. `#0096FF` (`brand`) is the mark, the focus ring, and the active indicator. Never for text.
- Radius by role: `rounded-md` chips and tooltips, `rounded-xl` controls, fields, and menus, `rounded-2xl` sheets and cards, `rounded-full` avatars, dots, and icon buttons. Nothing else.
- Type: `text-caption`, `text-meta`, `text-body`, `text-title`, `text-page`, `text-display`. Numbers are `tabular-nums`.
- System UI font in the app. Sora only on marketing.

## Composition

- Pages open on the work. No wordmark, greeting, or date block above it.
- Lists are `ListRow`: identity, one truncated preview line, when, one `Stamp`, compact actions. Tables only for numeric admin data.
- Row actions: Call and WhatsApp are 44px `IconButton`. Confirm and Done are labeled tonal `Button size="sm"`.
- Filters are `Segmented` underline tabs.
- Detail is split pane from `lg`, stacked below.
- Save docks to the form: sticky footer above the tab bar on phone, end of section on desktop.
- Every route has a shaped `loading.tsx`, an `Empty` that names the next action, and inline error with retry.

## Copy

- Verbs and nouns the owner already knows. Sentence case. No filler, no instructional subheaders, no exclamation marks.
- No em dashes or en dashes in UI strings. Hyphens in compound words are fine.
- Run `/no-ai-slop` on every new UI string. If the line could sit on another product unchanged, cut it.

## Product, not infra

Admin is a universal app (WhatsApp / Instagram / Truecaller bar). Screens show the job: people, money, line up or down.
- Do not put vendor setup in product UI: Resend Create domain, DNS records, API keys, fingerprints, env var names, git SHAs.
- Who we notify are people (name, phone, email) under Escalate or Settings. Not a comma mailbox. Not ops mail as a heading.
- Connect domain, DNS, and keys in infra. Leave them off the page.

## Motion and access

- Verbs: pending, live, land, shift, press. Under 300ms, `--ease-out`. Reduced motion snaps.
- Overlays use `Sheet`: a bottom drawer. The finger tracks it. A downward flick dismisses it. No motion package.
- Settings sections stay pages with Back. A drawer is a short confirm or chooser. Admin confirms use `ConfirmSheet`.
- 44px hit floor. Icon-only controls carry a visible name on hover and focus. Focus ring `ring-2 ring-brand`.

## Proof

- Playwright visual gate at 360, 390, 768, 1280, light and dark, before a PR is ready. Class-string tests are guards, not proof.
